BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:México City AI\, Machine Learning and Computer Vision Meetup|July
  1 - Getting Started with FiftyOne|Online
DTSTART:20260701T100000
CATEGORIES:ai,cloud,data,frontend,python
DESCRIPTION:México City AI\, Machine Learning and Computer Vision Meetup\
 nThis workshop is part of our Getting Started with FiftyOne monthly series
  — a recurring session designed to help you build a strong foundation in
  data-centric AI workflows.\n\n**Time\, Place and Location**\n\nJuly 1\, 2
 026\n9 AM PST - 10 AM PST\nOnline. **[Register for the Zoom!](https://voxe
 l51.com/events/getting-started-with-fiftyone-july-1-2026)**\n\nIn this ses
 sion\, you’ll learn how to manage large-scale computer vision datasets u
 sing open source FiftyOne. We’ll cover how to curate\, visualize\, and e
 valuate your data and models — with a focus on improving data quality ov
 er brute-force model iteration.\n\nYou’ll walk away with a repeatable fr
 amework for building data-centric AI pipelines across research and product
 ion.\n\n**What you’ll learn:**\n\n* Structure unstructured data into que
 ryable schemas (images\, video\, point clouds)\n* Query datasets using the
  FiftyOne SDK with filters\, tags\, and confidence thresholds\n* Visualize
  high-dimensional embeddings to identify clusters\, gaps\, and outliers\n*
  Automate data curation and prioritize high-value samples for labeling\n* 
 Debug model performance using evaluation tools (confusion matrices\, PR cu
 rves)\n* Customize FiftyOne with dashboards and interactive panels\n\n**Pr
 erequisites:**\n\n* Working knowledge of Python\n* Familiarity with machin
 e learning and/or computer vision fundamentals
LOCATION:Online event\,
END:VEVENT
